<title>USA: Deadwood, S.D., won by Dougherty Dawkins.</title>
<headline>Deadwood, S.D., won by Dougherty Dawkins.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dougherty Dawkins, Strand &amp; Bigelow, Inc. said it won $4.900 million of Deadwood, S.Dd., parking improvement revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 6.73 percent.</p>
</text>
